      "summaryZh": "微软官方博客发文，指出随着AI时代到来，网络安全范式正在发生根本性变化。自主系统能够推理、适应并持续运行，同时攻击成本下降，而需要保护的数据量、速度和复杂性不断增长。为此，微软提出“Project Perception”项目，旨在构建新的网络安全技术栈，以应对AI时代的挑战。",
      "summaryEn": "Microsoft's official blog post argues that the cybersecurity paradigm is fundamentally changing in the age of AI. Autonomous systems can reason, adapt, and operate continuously, while the cost of offense is falling and the volume, velocity, and complexity of what must be secured continues to grow. To address this, Microsoft introduces 'Project Perception', aiming to build a new cybersecurity stack for the AI era.",
